  "question": {
    "text": "A mineral has molecular formula <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> . <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions are arranged in ccp and cations of X are present in octahedral voids. Cations of Y are equally distributed among octahedral and tetrahedral voids. The fraction of the octahedral voids occupied will be",
    "image": null
  },
