  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Number of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions = n <br/>Number of tetrahedral voids = 2n <br/>Number of octahedral voids = n <br/>Number of Y ions <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> , <br/>Number of X ions <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/>Occupied octahedral voids <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/>So fraction of occupied octahedral voids <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> .",
